      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Though my visemes always trigger and animate as expected, I trigger a particle emission on certain visemes (emitter max 3 particles for performance; frosty breath).\nOver time, the trigger seems to just stop firing. I'm using states in the controller. I attribute this to the fact that the parameter is changing too often. May try a blend tree to see if it improves.\nedit: cannot do this with a blend tree. i rebuilt this lately and ensured i had 0-duration transitions, seems better.",
      "viewerReactions": null
